      "id": "reading",
      "className": "panel",
      "type": "rich",
      "html": "<span class=\"number\">INPUT · 4 MIN</span><h2>Read, listen to your own voice, and notice</h2><p class=\"instruction\">Read once for meaning. Then read aloud; on the second pass, notice how the speaker uses whole phrases.</p><div class=\"reading\">Hi, I'm Leo. I work as a developer, and I'm part of the product team. I usually start by checking messages at eight thirty. The first thing I do is read anything urgent from my team. After that, I plan my tasks. I often write code before lunch because the office is quiet. In the afternoon, I help our team test new pages. At the end of the day, I send a short update. My main responsibility is building useful tools, but I also make time to help a colleague when they get stuck.</div>"
    },
