      "id": "chunks",
      "className": "panel",
      "type": "chunks",
      "label": "CHUNKS · 5 MIN",
      "heading": "Five chunks to use today",
      "instruction": "Learn the whole phrase. Change the details to fit your work. Mở từng thẻ khi cần; sau đó nhìn đi chỗ khác và nói lại.",
      "items": [
        {
          "label": "1/5 · Luyện hôm nay",
          "phrase": "I usually start by…",
          "meaning": "Tôi thường bắt đầu bằng việc…",
          "details": [
            "Describe how you begin your workday.",
            "I usually start by + verb-ing",
            "I usually start by checking messages.",
            "I usually start by reviewing my task list."
          ],
          "saveKey": "chunk-v1-used-1"
        },
        {
          "label": "2/5 · Luyện hôm nay",
          "phrase": "The first thing I do is…",
          "meaning": "Việc đầu tiên tôi làm là…",
          "details": [
            "Name your first action at work.",
            "The first thing I do is + base verb",
            "The first thing I do is check my email.",
            "The first thing I do is read messages from my team."
          ],
          "saveKey": "chunk-v1-used-2"
        },
        {
          "label": "3/5 · Luyện hôm nay",
          "phrase": "After that, I…",
          "meaning": "Sau đó, tôi…",
          "details": [
            "Move to the next step in your routine.",
            "After that, I + verb",
            "After that, I check my tasks.",
            "After that, I join our morning meeting."
          ],
          "saveKey": "chunk-v1-used-3"
        },
        {
          "label": "4/5 · Luyện hôm nay",
          "phrase": "I often…",
          "meaning": "Tôi thường…",
          "details": [
            "Describe an activity you do regularly.",
            "I often + verb",
            "I often work from home.",
            "I often review code before lunch."
          ],
          "saveKey": "chunk-v1-used-4"
        },
        {
          "label": "5/5 · Luyện hôm nay",
          "phrase": "At the end of the day…",
